// The inspectable products (plan P1-03; design T9 A3) — X-macro read by
// engine/src/api/doc.h (Doc::product), tsrc --stage=<name> and the golden
// runner. PRODUCT(name, stage): the stage that must have run first.
// `semantic` is taken right after Resolve, before any host answer (the
// golden runner's pre-token dump); `diags` and `settings` are available at
// any stage. `program` is the LowerProgram's bytes (binary: the recorder
// runs it), `lower` its dump. `css` is the semantic page's stylesheet
// (rulesToCss, plan P3-01).
PRODUCT(skeleton, Compile)
PRODUCT(ast, Compile)
PRODUCT(js, Compile)
PRODUCT(lower, Compile)
PRODUCT(program, Compile)
PRODUCT(tokens, Compile)
PRODUCT(outline, Compile)
PRODUCT(codelangs, Compile)  // (plan P5-02) its code fences' language tags: the host loads their highlighters early
PRODUCT(astjson, Compile)
PRODUCT(ops, Ingest)
PRODUCT(tree, Resolve)
PRODUCT(index, Resolve)
PRODUCT(semantic, Resolve)
PRODUCT(css, Resolve)
PRODUCT(blocktree, BoxTree)
PRODUCT(mathir, Emit)
PRODUCT(mathbox, Measure)
PRODUCT(hlist, Measure)
PRODUCT(breaks, Layout)
PRODUCT(layout, Layout)
PRODUCT(vlist, Layout)
PRODUCT(paged, Paginate)
PRODUCT(html, Paint)
PRODUCT(dl, Paint)
PRODUCT(diags, Compile)
PRODUCT(diagnostics, Compile)  // (plan P3-37) the diagnostics as JSON, for hosts
PRODUCT(settings, Compile)
PRODUCT(references, Resolve)
PRODUCT(docinfo, Resolve)
PRODUCT(labels, Resolve)  // (plan P3-31) its labels for the other documents of its project
PRODUCT(contents, Resolve)  // (post-P5) its contents for a host's navigation: numbers formatted, titles as HTML
